      "created_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:41.101Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They make it sound like they haven’t hit 2 hours in an editor’s note before</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-89\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #89</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Another live show! Show Notes: Run Time: 2:06:07 Over two hours?! Yes, but just barely! Look, we had a lot to go through, and that makes us all smartthinkers, don't you think? Here's the upcoming schedule:&nbsp;   Tuesday, April 1st: Episode #314 -...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, April 1st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#314</span> - Writers’ Room: A digital foe in a digital realm</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 8th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#315</span> - Writers’ Room: Bunker Busters</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 15th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#316</span> - Writers’ Room: Wraith vs the Order of the Simple Machines</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 22nd: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#90</span> SCIENCE</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 29th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#317</span> - Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life: Benchmark</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected Recording Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, March 28: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#314</span> - Writers’ Room: A digital foe in a digital realm</li>\n<li>Friday, April 4th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#315</span> - Writers’ Room: Bunker Busters</li>\n<li>Friday, April 11th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#316</span> - Writers’ Room: Wraith vs the Order of the Simple Machines</li>\n<li>Friday, April 18th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#90</span> SCIENCE</li>\n<li>Friday, April 25th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#317</span> - Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life: Benchmark</li>\n</ul>",
