      "raw": "They make it sound like they haven’t hit 2 hours in an editor’s note before \n\nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-89\n\nUpcoming Schedule:\n* Tuesday, April 1st: Episode #314 - Writers' Room: A digital foe in a digital realm\n* Tuesday, April 8th: Episode #315 - Writers' Room: Bunker Busters\n* Tuesday, April 15th: Episode #316 - Writers' Room: Wraith vs the Order of the Simple Machines\n* Tuesday, April 22nd: Editor’s Note #90 SCIENCE\n* Tuesday, April 29th: Episode #317 - Writers' Room: A Day in the Life: Benchmark\n\nExpected Recording Schedule:\n* Friday, March 28: Episode #314 - Writers' Room: A digital foe in a digital realm\n* Friday, April 4th: Episode #315 - Writers' Room: Bunker Busters\n* Friday, April 11th: Episode #316 - Writers' Room: Wraith vs the Order of the Simple Machines\n* Friday, April 18th: Editor’s Note #90 SCIENCE\n* Friday, April 25th: Episode #317 - Writers' Room: A Day in the Life: Benchmark",
