      "id": 262865,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-03-18T16:28:39.362Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ooh, I’m excited by the Order of the Simple Machine showing up in a comic. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> And ADITL Benchmark, awesome!</p>\n<p>Next up, the story about how Christopher survived a tornado.</p>\n<p>Windows Update, my least favorite thing!</p>\n<p>Good SPPB reference there!</p>\n<p>Ooh, episode pi is coming up!</p>\n<p>He’s right about hte peanut butter, you know.</p>\n<p>Okay, so the next RPG module is going to revolve around the Cult of the Sandwich Bag, got it.</p>\n<p>Oh yeah, Sentinels of the Multiverse, heard good things about that game.</p>\n<p>A card called “Retcon” in Sentinels of the Multiverse? Nah, that would never work!</p>\n<p>I get the snail reference!</p>\n<p>Okay, there are way more letters in this than I had anticipated, and they are kind of getting more unhinged as time goes on. c_c; Help.</p>\n<p>No, Ra’s pet name for Fanatic is not “Cupcake”, I’m vetoing this. XD</p>\n<p>Wow, fresh Paul, on tap? This place is the greatest!</p>\n<p>Obviously, Animalverse Gunrat is Gunman.</p>\n<p>Neon Necromancer variant could turn his ongoings and/or instruments into targets.</p>\n<p>Adam’s got the same problem with blackberries as my dad!</p>",
