      "raw": "Ooh, I'm excited by the Order of the Simple Machine showing up in a comic. :D And ADITL Benchmark, awesome!\n\nNext up, the story about how Christopher survived a tornado.\n\nWindows Update, my least favorite thing!\n\nGood SPPB reference there!\n\nOoh, episode pi is coming up!\n\nHe's right about hte peanut butter, you know.\n\nOkay, so the next RPG module is going to revolve around the Cult of the Sandwich Bag, got it.\n\nOh yeah, Sentinels of the Multiverse, heard good things about that game.\n\nA card called \"Retcon\" in Sentinels of the Multiverse? Nah, that would never work!\n\nI get the snail reference!\n\nOkay, there are way more letters in this than I had anticipated, and they are kind of getting more unhinged as time goes on. c_c; Help.\n\nNo, Ra's pet name for Fanatic is not \"Cupcake\", I'm vetoing this. XD\n\nWow, fresh Paul, on tap? This place is the greatest!\n\nObviously, Animalverse Gunrat is Gunman.\n\nNeon Necromancer variant could turn his ongoings and/or instruments into targets.\n\nAdam's got the same problem with blackberries as my dad!",
