      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/{size}/4865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-03-20T13:39:26.639Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I feel like Ra’s opinions about the treatment of mummies (the dead kind, not like Anubis’s guardians) would be nuanced. He’s fully aware that there is no Egyptian afterlife, because that’s where his bunch came from and it’s a dead hell dimension now. Like, in the Sentinels lore, all the Egyptian religious beliefs are misunderstandings (intentionally or not) of the powers of extradimensional beings,  right?</p>",
