      "raw": "[quote=\"Escher, post:6, topic:31425\"]\nHe’s fully aware that there is no Egyptian afterlife, because that’s where his bunch came from and it’s a dead hell dimension now. Like, in the Sentinels lore, all the Egyptian religious beliefs are misunderstandings (intentionally or not) of the powers of extradimensional beings, right?\n[/quote]\n\nOnly sort of. The Egyptian afterlife realm is still a real place, and some dead spirits still go there. [As can the living.](https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php/Podcasts/Episode_267) So, if anything, he should have *more* respect for the Egyptian afterlife rituals than mundane Egyptians.",
