      "raw": "The final editor's note.  I fully support FRG having the right to pull the plug on a brand which they could no longer afford, but if they could have waited just a week longer, not only would the planned science editor's note #90 have happened, but they might have gotten Disparation out months earlier, given how incredibly close it was to finished when they pulled the plug.\n\nIf Raymond Mantae's paranoia is what keeps Dark Visionary from killing him, I would in fact say that he is *not* TOO paranoid.\n\nSmart Thinker put out two ideas in this episode's letters which reflect interestingly on each other: a singular entity of patience, and a Newsiverse where that entity has clearly never been, any more than The Fervor has gone to a universe where The Grey absorbed all other realms.\n\n\"things Ra does other than Fanatic\" *snort* 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣😭😭😭🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣",
